{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か？個握ラストでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃん生誕出たよ(◌•ω•◌ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃんの生誕の方たちが\nあやねちゃんを見守る姿が\nお父さんみたいでかわいかったよ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"各生誕委員の方\n素敵な生誕祭お疲れ様でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今シングルもたくさんたくさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてその個握の後"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアル車将棋"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というイベントに参加してきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコ生で放送してたけど見てくれたかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"西武ドームを使って\n大きな大きな盤を用意して\n車を将棋の駒に見立てての対局！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごくシュールで、面白かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大盤解説も初めて\n参加させていただいたんですが、\n緊張したあああヾ(｡>﹏<｡)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもいい経験をさせていただきました、\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女流棋士の香川さんと\n写真も撮ってもらっちゃった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"香川さんは同い年でかわいくて\nすごく気さくな素敵な方でした♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またお会いできたらいいなあ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして西武ドームについてのレポ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ステージ予定図が公開されたので\nざっくり加工してみた。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタンド席の一番後ろの席は\n完全に屋外でした！(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく寒い。\n想像をはるかに超えた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこで風が吹いたりなんかしたら\nもう、それは極寒(′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)ははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「俺はいつもライブの時は\n半袖のライブTで過ごすから\n今回も気合でそうしてやるー！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちはわかりますが、\nライブTの上に必ず何か羽織りましょう。\n必ずです。必ず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「俺は寒いところ出身だから\nへっちゃらへっちゃら」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"地元の寒さとはまた違うかと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「恥ずかしさを捨てて\nスノボウェアで行こうかな！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全な勝ち組です！\nしかも今回ポンチョが配られるので\nスノボウェアの上にポンチョ着たら\n恥ずかしさもなくなる(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろんみんなでライブを盛り上げて\n熱いライブにしたいと思ってますが、\n気持ちは熱くなるけど、\n体感温度という見なくてはいけない現実も\nやっぱりあるので。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん自分の出来る最大限の\n防寒の用意をお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒さ対策して、ライブを\n楽しみましょうヾ(◜▿‾ ( ´▿｀ ) ‾▿◝)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が私の指定した日(13日ごと)\nの方のみ僭越ながら\nお祝いさせていただきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日早いけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.15 birthday!!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢花ちゃん\nみきりんさん\nまなさん\n横浜のたかし@2度目の成人式！さん\nkeigo さまーずさん\nあおりんこさん\nよごさんの弟さん\nしーさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちと一緒に素敵な1年に\nしましょうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日次回予告 2月28日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15日日曜日 朝10:00より\nNHK Eテレにて\n「将棋フォーカス」\nにゲスト出演させていただきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以前握手会でカメラが入ってたのも\nこちらの番組の密着でした＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会の時の楽屋の様子や\nその他メンバーも写ってますので\n将棋や私に興味のない方も\n観ていただけたら嬉しいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひぜひご覧ください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/02/13/3639694/0016.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は100回目のブログだ♡\n似顔絵会録音会は\nまた改めて書きます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}